# Python virtualenvs, caches and build artefacts (the images build their own .venv).
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
coverage
.coverage*
**/coverage.xml

# Secrets stay out of image layers; runtime configuration is injected by the selected launcher.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Re-exclude node_modules, and KEEP THIS LAST: .dockerignore is last-match-wins.
**/node_modules/**
**/.venv/**
